Dear {{student_name}},

This is to inform you that a room inspection has been scheduled for your accommodation.

**Inspection Details:**
- Building: {{building_name}}
- Room Number: {{room_number}}
- Date: {{inspection_date}}
- Time: {{inspection_time}}
- Type: {{inspection_type}}
- Inspector: {{inspector_name}}

**What to Expect:**
- Please ensure your room is accessible at the scheduled time
- The inspection typically takes 15-30 minutes
- You may be present during the inspection if you wish

**Preparation:**
- Please ensure the room is tidy and accessible
- Remove any valuable or personal items you'd prefer not to be disturbed
- Ensure all appliances and fixtures are accessible

{{notes}}

If you have any questions or concerns, please contact the Housing Office.

Best regards,
Housing Management Team
University Housing Services
